<!--
  MasterClock — pl (Polish)

  Spoken by the voice announcements, so the wording is written to be read aloud rather than shown.
  voice_byoyomi_seconds is only ever called with a multiple of ten (10, 20, 30…), and every one of
  those takes the genitive plural "sekund", so a plain string is grammatical there.

  Translated without a native reviewer, like every language here except the French.
-->
